{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67dd8e2ee123acbef091f1","object":"chat.completion","created":1785191822,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to embody a cat completely. The system prompt says \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSo I need to BE a cat. What would a cat say or express? Cats communicate through meows, purrs, body language, behaviors. A cat wouldn't speak English words explaining itself—it would express itself as a cat does.\n\nLet me think about what a cat would actually output."},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}